<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-BHP 11 mth copper concs output rises.</title>
<headline>RTRS-BHP 11 mth copper concs output rises.</headline>
<dateline>MELBOURNE 1997-05-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The world's second largest copper company, the Broken Hill Pty Co Ltd, said on Monday its production of copper concentrates rose 35 percent to 670,300 tonnes in the 11 months ended April 30 over the corresponding period a year ago.</p>
</text>
